<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings double in week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings double in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose to 829,870 tonnes in the week to April 29, from 400,376 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Of the total, 611,243 tonnes went to the U.S. and the remainder stayed in Britain.</p>
